 .../MOD_BGC_Soil_BiogeochemCompetition.F90    | 69 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../MOD_BGC_Soil_BiogeochemLittVertTransp.F90 |  9 ++-
 3 files changed, 77 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

